with you, Prince.

00:17:38.891 --> 00:17:40.635
Oh, Prince?

00:17:40.659 --> 00:17:42.127
Prince?

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.448
That's...

00:18:05.217 --> 00:18:07.362
We apologize for the interruption!

00:18:07.386 --> 00:18:08.863
For reasons we cannot explain,

00:18:08.887 --> 00:18:10.732
Those Who Hunt Elves have decided
to crash your little party!

00:18:10.756 --> 00:18:13.248
Intruders! We must protect the Prince!

00:18:13.759 --> 00:18:15.227
Grab them!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.998
Mike, now!

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:39.884
Bring us your elves!

00:18:40.986 --> 00:18:42.545
Bring them all!

00:18:43.522 --> 00:18:44.990
Please, let me through!

00:18:45.891 --> 00:18:47.359
Are you one of them?

00:18:48.393 --> 00:18:49.861
How about you?

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:53.241
Sorry about this! Sorry! Sorry!

00:18:53.265 --> 00:18:55.029
| really do apologize!

00:18:57.936 --> 00:18:59.814
Where are they?

00:18:59.838 --> 00:19:01.549
Stop it!

00:19:01.573 --> 00:19:04.133
| will not allow you to harass
these innocent women!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.435
You want a piece of me, pretty boy?

00:19:12.484 --> 00:19:13.952
Watch out!

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.271
Are you okay?

00:19:23.295 --> 00:19:23.538
Yes, are you?
Are you okay?

00:19:23.562 --> 00:19:24.572
Yes, are you?

00:19:24.596 --> 00:19:24.772
Yes, are you?
Yes, I feel great!

00:19:24.796 --> 00:19:26.525
Yes, I feel great!

00:19:27.099 --> 00:19:28.877
| found one!

00:19:28.901 --> 00:19:30.245
No, Junpei!

00:19:30.269 --> 00:19:30.378
Forgive me for doing this!
No, Junpei!

00:19:30.402 --> 00:19:32.234
Forgive me for doing this!

00:19:38.443 --> 00:19:40.655
Aw hell, no spell fragments.

00:19:40.679 --> 00:19:42.841
What the hell is your problem,
you maniac?!

00:19:43.582 --> 00:19:46.574
Well, damn, all this trouble for nothing.

00:19:46.952 --> 00:19:48.420
Oh, hi, Ms. Airi!

00:19:52.591 --> 00:19:54.102
Ms. Airi?

00:19:54.126 --> 00:19:55.003
Colleena...

00:19:55.027 --> 00:19:55.603
Ms. Airi...
Colleena...

00:19:55.627 --> 00:19:56.492
Ms. Airi...

00:19:58.497 --> 00:20:00.591
You're the one who called me
a "maniac", aren't you?

00:20:01.667 --> 00:20:04.045
Hey, watch where you're
driving, you maniac!

00:20:04.069 --> 00:20:07.039
| haven't stopped thinking about
you ever since that day.

00:20:07.773 --> 00:20:09.484
| didn't recognize you at first.

00:20:09.508 --> 00:20:11.953
Not while you were wearing
that fancy dress.

00:20:11.977 --> 00:20:16.437
Am I to arrogantly assume that you
came here tonight to dance with me?

00:20:18.884 --> 00:20:20.352
Music.

00:20:33.232 --> 00:20:35.977
And as for our intruders...
You made a big mess,

00:20:36.001 --> 00:20:38.060
but at least you created
some excitement.

00:20:45.444 --> 00:20:47.879
What were you doing at
the ball, Ms. Airi?

00:20:48.247 --> 00:20:50.215
Were you hunting for elves too?

00:20:50.816 --> 00:20:54.980
Did you have any adventures
in the city, Ms. Airi?

00:20:55.887 --> 00:20:58.499
Don't hold out on us. Tell us.

00:20:58.523 --> 00:21:00.924
Yeah, don't be shy.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:03.705
No adventures.

00:21:03.729 --> 00:21:07.097
Just a little girl who wanted all
of her dreams to come true.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.498
Just like me when I was her age.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.461
Hang on a second!

00:21:26.485 --> 00:21:31.366
Why did I have to be punched out by
Ms. Airi because I stripped an elf?

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.867
That's what this show is about,

00:21:32.891 --> 00:21:35.103
and I didn't even get that many
lines in this episode!

00:21:35.127 --> 00:21:36.595
Now I'm depressed!

00:21:53.712 --> 00:22:00.795
It's okay to take a break on a day
when you feel despondent

00:22:00.819 --> 00:22:07.418
Life is long and fickle, you know

00:22:07.793 --> 00:22:14.909
| can make you a hundred
times stronger

00:22:14.933 --> 00:22:18.146
Come on, let's sleep for now

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:21.629
Hold me gently

00:22:22.074 --> 00:22:27.035
Even if you met a dinosaur

00:22:29.181 --> 00:22:35.863
You are the kind of person that
would just laugh it off

00:22:35.887 --> 00:22:42.570
Winning through flower gardens
and storm ravaged plains

00:22:42.594 --> 00:22:50.211
| can hear how the times are
changing around us

00:22:50.235 --> 00:22:56.884
Distinguishing both the
sour and the sweet

00:22:56.908 --> 00:23:04.908
Just don't give up, because the genius
always comes at the end

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:14.202
Hey, you want to grab
something to eat?

00:23:14.226 --> 00:23:16.204
How about hamburgers?
Or beef cakes?

00:23:16.228 --> 00:23:17.872
Or a bowl of noodles?!

00:23:17.896 --> 00:23:19.507
Red bean bowls are good tool!

00:23:19.531 --> 00:23:21.761
But beef bowls are my favorite!

00:23:23.335 --> 00:23:27.897
Look at this! I can't fit into the
petite sizes anymore!

00:23:28.306 --> 00:23:30.070
Is the next episode going
to be like this?

00:23:30.542 --> 00:23:33.054
Next Those Who Hunt Elves:

00:23:33.078 --> 00:23:35.256
"The EIf Who Couldn't Undress!"

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:37.339
| better go on a diet before
the next show!
